  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-340-357">竹は直角、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-357-392">人のくびより根が生え、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-392-424">根がうすくひろごり、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-424-450">ほのかにけぶる。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-450-504" style="padding-inline-start: 11em">
        <p><seg source="#source-474-504">――大正四年元旦――</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
